---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Website Usage Terms | BDSM Test"
  description="Read the Terms of Service governing the use of the BDSM Test website, our 18+ adult policy, and user guidelines."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <Header activePath="/terms" />

  <main class="flex-1 py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-16 h-80 hero-mesh"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="mb-10">
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-mute shadow-xs">
          Legal & Usage
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-1.2px] text-ink">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-mono text-mute">Last updated: November 2026</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs space-y-8 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using the BDSM Test website (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, you must discontinue using the website immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-border pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">2. Age Requirement (18+)</h2>
          <p>
            The Service addresses adult themes, power dynamics, and mature intimacy topics. You affirm that you are at least eighteen (18) years of age, or the legal age of majority in your jurisdiction. Access by minors is strictly prohibited.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-border pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">3. Educational & Informational Purpose Only</h2>
          <p>
            The assessments, archetypes, and generated analysis provided on this website are designed exclusively for personal reflection, educational self-discovery, and romantic communication between consenting adults.
          </p>
          <p>
            The Service does not provide psychological, psychiatric, therapeutic, marital counseling, legal, or medical advice. The results should not be used as a substitute for professional evaluation or therapy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-border pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">4. Responsible & Consensual Practice</h2>
          <p>
            The inclusion of any archetype, dynamic, or sensation preference does not constitute a recommendation, endorsement, or instruction to engage in hazardous activities. Users are solely responsible for ensuring that any activities they choose to explore are conducted with continuous, enthusiastic, and informed mutual consent under recognized harm reduction frameworks (such as Safe, Sane, Consensual and Risk-Aware Consensual Kink).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-border pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            The design, text, question taxonomy, algorithms, code, graphics, and layout of this website are the intellectual property of BDSM Test and are protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws. You may share your personal result links freely, but you may not scrape, reproduce, sell, or mirror the software or content without prior written permission.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-border pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">6. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            The Service is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. Under no circumstances shall BDSM Test or its contributors be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from the use or inability to use this website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-border pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">7. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

